OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine and
OL,6,Fpartly cloudy into the evening. Clear
OL,7,Fspells linger overnight leading to the
OL,8,Fodd patch of mist and fog developing.
OL,9,FCloud increasing from the northwest
OL,10,Flater, with some patchy light rain by
OL,11,Fdawn. Milder than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA cloudy and damp start, as a
OL,14,Fband of light rain moves
OL,15,Fsoutheastwards across all parts.
OL,16,FBecoming drier into the afternoon.
OL,17,FClearer spells developing by evening.
OL,18,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
